      "writtenOn": "2024-11-21T09:57:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Probably you have right. Names are very confusing here:\n```\nLeAudioService#pauseBroadcast \u003e broadcaster#SuspendAudioBroadcast \u003e ProcessMessage(BroadcastStateMachine::Message::SUSPEND) \u003e BroadcastStateMachine::State::CONFIGURED\n```\nIs this correct path? If so then you can resolve a comment. Thanks.",
