        "id": 3256421
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-21T09:57:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If so then it should be ok.\nI worried that i.e. we can get OnAudioResume (once) before we call StartAudioBroadcast which lead to not call:\n```\nProcessMessage(BroadcastStateMachine::Message::START\n```\nIf we are safe there you can resolve a comment. Thanks",
      "parentUuid": "c6a54cc8_83ac9b53",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1356,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1356,
        "endChar": 58
      },
